      "content": "but i don't really want to go to the doctor if i don't have to, it's a hassle and expensive. if i just cool it down and then put a thick layer of that tea tree oil on it, won't the oil help it heal faster and keep the air off it? i read online that tea tree is super antimicrobial so it should prevent infection anyway, right?",
