      "content": "okay i get that but i'm just really trying to avoid a clinic visit if i can. if i use a very high concentration of the tea tree oil, like a pure essential oil soak, wouldn't the antiseptic properties basically act like a medical grade cleaner for the wound? i just feel like i can manage it at home if i'm careful with the dosage.",
